Hook Purpose <code>useScrollTracker</code> Track scroll depth (25%, 50%, 75%, 90%, 100%) <code>useClickTracker</code> Track clicks with component context <code>useAPITracker</code> Track API calls with timing <code>usePageLeaveTracker</code> Track page exit and duration <pre><code>import { useScrollTracker, useAPITracker } from '@plexusone/telemetry';

function ArticlePage() {
  // Track scroll depth at 25%, 50%, 75%, 100%
  useScrollTracker({ thresholds: [25, 50, 75, 100] });

  return &lt;Article /&gt;;
}

function DataFetcher() {
  const { trackRequest, trackResponse } = useAPITracker();

  const fetchData = async () =&gt; {
    trackRequest('GET', '/api/data');
    const response = await fetch('/api/data');
    trackResponse('GET', '/api/data', response.status, duration);
  };
}
</code></pre>

Component Exports Button <code>Button</code>, <code>buttonVariants</code> Form controls <code>Input</code>, <code>Label</code> Card <code>Card</code>, <code>CardHeader</code>, <code>CardTitle</code>, <code>CardDescription</code>, <code>CardContent</code>, <code>CardFooter</code> Avatar <code>Avatar</code>, <code>AvatarImage</code>, <code>AvatarFallback</code> Dropdown menu <code>DropdownMenu</code>, <code>DropdownMenuTrigger</code>, <code>DropdownMenuContent</code>, <code>DropdownMenuItem</code> and the other parts Tooltip <code>Tooltip</code>, <code>TooltipTrigger</code>, <code>TooltipContent</code>, <code>TooltipProvider</code> Badge <code>Badge</code>, <code>badgeVariants</code> Separator <code>Separator</code> Icons <code>MenuIcon</code>, <code>UserIcon</code>, <code>SunIcon</code>, <code>MoonIcon</code>, <code>MonitorIcon</code> and others <p><code>cn</code> merges class names, resolving conflicting Tailwind classes.</p> <pre><code>import { Button, Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from '@plexusone/ui';

&lt;Card&gt;
  &lt;CardHeader&gt;
    &lt;CardTitle&gt;Sites&lt;/CardTitle&gt;
  &lt;/CardHeader&gt;
  &lt;CardContent&gt;
    &lt;Button&gt;Add site&lt;/Button&gt;
  &lt;/CardContent&gt;
&lt;/Card&gt;;
</code></pre>
